      "get": {
        "summary": "Official Brazilian Economic Indicators",
        "description": "Returns official interest rates (Selic target, Selic daily, CDI annual, CDI daily) and inflation metrics (IPCA 12-month accumulated and monthly) from the Central Bank of Brazil (BCB) and IBGE. Settled via x402 on Base (0.0050 USDC). Free teaser preview available on 402 challenge.",
